# T119: both confirmations of the deletion of the data folder: it is gone, the app's files were already gone.
# scenario demo
# expect-no-file applications/app-01.bin
# expect-no-file system/app-01/notes.db
# expect-no-file system/app-01/sub/more.db
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
tap appRow 0
waitfor detailState Installed
tap actionRemove
waitfor planSummary Remove App app-01
tap confirm
waitfor resultText App app-01 was removed
tap askDelete
waitfor deletePrompt Delete the data of this app?
tap deleteData
waitfor deletePrompt files
tap deleteData
waitfor resultText data folder
expect resultText deleted
tap ok
waitfor appRow
quit
